When starting or restructuring an AI course/project, follow the VinUni AI Project skill pack:

`K:\AI_IN_ACTION\vinuni-ai-project-skill\vinuni-ai-project`

Do not code immediately. Ask intake questions, shape scope using presets as guidance, draft the needed artifacts, then ask for approval.

Backend and frontend are wrappers unless the confirmed scope says otherwise. Prioritize agent design, eval cases, logs, context summary, worklog, decision log, and handoff.

For team/work projects, add specs, ADRs, contracts, DoD, and review discipline only when needed.